vowels-context.json.gz is also CC BY-SA 4.0. It holds word forms, counts and
context parameters from HomoRich training, Ganjoor editorial marks, Hedayat
stories, Persian Wikisource and Wikipedia. Reviewed lexical sense families
are included as word facts. The fallback uses the word lexicon listed above;
its separately calibrated scores are stored without a second copy of the lexicon.
Controlled grammar training/calibration examples are original CC0 material;
only their derived parameters are included. Biological compound readings are
normalized during training; public benchmark reference phonemes are unchanged.
Its provenance object names source snapshots, licences and the lexical input hash.
No sentences or poem passages are included. SentenceBench and HomoRich test
are exclusion and measurement inputs only. Held-out documents, development
documents and matching public sentences are excluded from training. Dictionary
headword exclusions apply at dictionary entry reads; they do not remove that
word's independent corpus evidence. Authored evaluation sentences supply no
training or calibration labels.
